\pard\sa120\sb120\fs32\b Configure-PhysicalBuild\b0{\*\bkmkstart configure-physicalbuild}{\*\bkmkend configure-physicalbuild}\par
\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Description\b0{\*\bkmkstart description}{\*\bkmkend description}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Gathers full server identity from OneView, resolves the ISO URL, runs pre-build validation, and prints a comprehensive summary of all destructive actions that will be performed. Designed for a second operator to review and approve before Start-PhysicalBuild is run. This command performs NO destructive actions - no ISO attach, no reboot, no firmware update. It is read-only / dry-run only.\par
