l}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -OneViewMaintenanceMode\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Enable HPE OneView maintenance mode before destructive operations (ISO mount, reboot) and disable it after the build completes. Set to $false to skip maintenance mode orchestration (e.g. when OneView is unavailable or the server is not managed by OneView). Default is $true. Use -NoMaintenanceMode to disable.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -NoMaintenanceMode\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Convenience switch to disable OneView maintenance mode. Equivalent to -OneViewMaintenanceMode:$false. Use this when OneView is unavailable or the server is not managed by OneView.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -SkipPreBuild\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Skip pre-build validation checks.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -SkipOneView\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Skip OneView target resolution.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx9026{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 {\f1 -SkipIlo\f0}\cell}{\pard\fi0\li60\ri60\fs22\sa40\sb40 Skip iLO credential / Redfish check.\cell}\row\trowd\trgaph60\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs\cellx4513\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\cl